  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>omecamtiv_mecarbil</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>C01CX10</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Chen PW et al. 2022</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>healthy subjects and patients with heart failure with reduced ejection fraction</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>omecamtiv mecarbil</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_omecamtiv_mecarbil/OmecamtivMecarbil_Chen2022_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>clearance</td><td>11.7</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>central volume distribution</td><td>275</td><td>L</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr><tr><td>half-life</td><td>33</td><td>hours</td><td><small>t1/2z</small></td></tr></table><h4>About omecamtiv_mecarbil</h4><p>Omecamtiv mecarbil is an investigational cardiac stimulant studied for the treatment of heart failure with reduced pumping function (systolic heart failure). It has not been approved; a marketing application in the European Union was withdrawn, so it remains an investigational drug.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q7089956\">Wikidata Q7089956</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.OmecamtivMecarbil\">OmecamtivMecarbil</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Chen PW et al. (2022). Population Pharmacokinetic Properties of Omecamtiv Mecarbil in Healthy Subjects and Patients With Heart Failure With Reduced Ejection Fraction. <i>Journal of cardiovascular pharmacology 79(4):539–548</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1097/FJC.0000000000001207\">10.1097/FJC.0000000000001207</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34983909\">34983909</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Chen_2022: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
